    "@en": "As in Spanish, many verbs have a reflective pronoun:\n\n- vaske **sig** = wash\n- barbere **sig** = shave\n- sætte **sig** = sit\n- Rejse **sig** = rise\n- kede **sig** = getting bored\n- skynde **sig** = hurry\n- gifte **sig** = get married\n\n**sig** for him, she, they: Nina slog **sig** (hurt done) Nina slog **hende** (hit another)."
